{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07536","headline":"杂诗六首 四 · 李华","name":"杂诗六首 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"阴魄沦宇宙，太阳假其明。\n臣道不敢专，由此见亏盈。\n未闻东菑稼，一气嘉谷成。\n上天降寒暑，地利乃可生。\n葛藟附柔木，繁阴蔽曾原。\n风霜摧枝干，不复庇本根。\n女萝依松柏，然後得长存。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李华","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07536.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07536","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}